I go to the office.
The office is large and bright.
There are many people here.
A young man comes near me.
He says, "Hello, I am Rohan."
"What is your name?"
I say, "Hello Rohan, my name is Maya."
He asks, "Maya, are you the new software engineer?"
I say, "Yes, I am new."
Rohan asks, "Do you have an ID card?"
I say, "Yes, I have an ID card."
He says, "Excellent, welcome to the office."
"In which team do you work?"
I say, "I work in the mobile app team."
Rohan says, "Great, my team is also there."
I say, "Thank you, Rohan."
We go inside.
